 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Meet My Wife, Who's Also My Fan"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh-ro": "Lǎopó Fěn Liǎo Jiè Yīxià"
   },
   {
    "zh": "老婆粉了解一下"
   },
   {
    "ja": "推しの噂相手に転生してしまった！？"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "As a wife fan of the popular idol Huo Xi, Qiao Qiao’s most hated person is Sheng Qiao, an actress who gets involved with Huo Xi for hype. Besides taking camera to join some activities, her major daily task is to diss this white lotus sincerely.\n\nWhat she didn’t expect is that she would become Sheng Qiao after she hit her head one day. During the shooting process of her first love drama with Huo Xi, the first scene was NG’d 27 times. Huo Xi: Sheng Qiao, can you do it or not? If you can’t , you can be replaced!\n\nQiao Qiao: Husband, don’t be angry, I can do it!\n\nHuo Xi: ? ? ?"
  },
